herdbook-menu is a modified copy of the `menu` mod shipped with the Herdr
desktop app 0.1.16 (https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app), licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE in this folder).

Changes from the original: "Rename pane" (opens herdbook-rename, or runs
`pane.rename` on Herdr 0.1.17+), "Rename tab", "Move to space…" (a list of the
machine's other spaces and a new one), and an "agent" menu for sidebar rows.
Moving uses `pane.move` / `tab.move` when Herdr has them with a `space`
argument, else `move.js` parks the terminals and keeps them in the target space.
